960-1821922921812643","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.3.0.5 Demo Update","summary":"Settings:On the first launch of the game, motion blur is now disabled by default.On the first launch of the game, the default anti-aliasing method is now FXAA instead of TSR, as TSR is blurry.UI:Added close button to the player level upgrades UI.Hack terminals mode now includes the player’s HP in the global HP bar. Previously, repeatedly hijacking enemies and taking heavy damage caused the global HP bar to become highly inaccurate; this change improves its accuracy.Bug Fixes:Fixed an issue where","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-15T12:12:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921812643","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1821288646588264","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.3.0.4 Demo Update","summary":"Fixed a bug where the guardian’s time stop legendary upgrade applied a 50% action speed bonus to enemies when the ability expired, which could then transfer to the player if the enemy was hijacked.Fixed a bug where trickster poison legendary upgrade was not working.Fixed a bug where the trickster poison legendary VFX could persist indefinitely on enemies in certain cases.Fixed multiple issues where overlapping action speed modifiers could incorrectly affect players and enemies.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-13T15:23:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646588264","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1821288646586786","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.3.0.3 Demo Update","summary":"Fixed crash in tutorial when trickster either AI or player would try to use poison ability.Fixed a deadlock when player is in hijacking process a robot which dies while you still in the process, which makes player stay in air completely unable to do anything.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-12T21:13:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646586786","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1821288646580440","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.3.0.2 Demo Update","summary":"Fixed crashes when encountering warden / minion boss.Optimized performance of trickster poison ability.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-09T09:56:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646580440","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1819386365123151","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.3.0.1 Demo Update","summary":"Now looking at enemies will show their HP bar.After leaving enemy body to hijack other, the previous body will be \"corrupted\" - not hijackable anymore.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-05T10:51:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365123151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1819386365119377","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.3 Demo Update","summary":"Player Character Changes:Sliding now respects movement direction.Player now will be impulsed from any explosive radial impulse effect.Guardian:Weapon does not have infinite ammo anymore.Weapon has 40 total ammo.Ranger:Buffed base hp (100 -> 110).Weapon ammo changed (30/200) -> (25/50).Trickster:Buffed base hp (100 -> 110).Weapon ammo changed (180/400) -> (80/80).AI Character Changes:Guardian kill gives more xp: (1 -> 2).Minion boss kill gives more xp: (20 -> 50).Warden kill gives more xp: (12 ->","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-02T16:46:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365119377","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1818752592127568","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.2.2 Demo Update","summary":"Player Changes:Removed crouch entirely.Now sliding is triggered only by \"C\", previously: \"Shift\"(Run) + \"C\".Ability Changes:- Guardian Time Stop Changes:Base time dilation strength nerfed (2.5x -> 2x).Added new upgrade modifier: Dilation - which increases dilation strength.Modified upgrades, mostly removed this ability stacking.- Trickster Emp Grenade Changes:Minion boss and Warden receives 2x less duration being disabled.Upgrade System Changes:Upgrade choices are now fully randomized outcomes (","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-12T13:13:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592127568","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1817483467037789","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.2.1 Demo Update","summary":"Gameplay changes:Changed spawning system that if you at least once saw the new character, it would always has chance to spawn without the need of certain threshold of enemies spawned in the next runs.UI changes:Run timer is added to the objective panel instead of being at the upper center of screen.Bug and crash fixes:Fixed a bug that projectiles from player(like guardian) would not apply damage falloff by range.Fixed a bug where some upgrades did not add damage properly to player abilities.Fixe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-27T20:56:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467037789","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1816307528974625","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"1.2 Demo Update","summary":"Optimization:Optimized chapter 1 navmesh.Game Mode:Reworked hack terminals mode, instead of timer now it is needed to kill enemies until total pool of hp is gone.UI:Reworked upgrade cards descriptions as an example it shows like this: (9s -> 6s) COOLDOWN, (1m -> 1.7m) SIZE.Reworked hijack mechanic:Hijack takes 1 sec to charge up.Player takes 0.5 sec to hijack an enemy.Player has 0.3 sec invincibility after hijacking enemy.Player has same % of max hp that AI enemy had when hijacking is completed.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-18T19:12:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528974625","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3480960-1815580768420984","game_id":"steam-3480960","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.1","summary":"Player changes:- While sliding it is possible to shoot now.Other changes:- Optimized a bit AI logic.- In non-possessive mode now hijack visual effect is shown on enemies.UI changes:- Tutorial explanation buttons \"Back\" and \"Next\" will disappear when they would not do any function.Bug / Crash fixes:- Fixed a bug where ranger mine damaged player himself.- Fixed a bug where ranger AI sometimes when deploying shield afterwards could shoot grenade directly at player.- Fixed a bug where some AI's woul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-11T10:28:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768420984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3480960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3480960":"2026-10-26T00:41:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3480960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"3851310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3480960","app_id":3480960,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8a48f761408fbc942662d95f583f7042be02c48477d4e2c214bc3dda84acb062","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Project Roy는 적 로봇을 해킹할 수 있는 AI가 되어 싸우는 빠른 템포의 FPS 로그라이크 게임입니다. 다양한 전투 유닛을 조종하고, 각자의 고유한 능력을 활용하며, 치명적인 기계의 물결을 뚫고 설리번 코퍼레이션의 지배에서 벗어나세요!","publishers":[{"name":"Dark Forest","creator_clan_account_id":46198557}],"developers":[{"name":"Dark Forest","creator_clan_account_id":46198557}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Announcement","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1779874237","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"3480960/771768339/6a04bafa1c08c39dadfd470b4cd7cf8451d775dc/1779871238/microtrailer.webm","type":"v